{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081760/extras/add_to_wishlist_text.png?t=1747341922\" />The path is not easy:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game challenges every player! Don't give up! The more you lose - the better you become!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You like sakura? No worries, mate! If you're into art, you'll find something here that you'll love! Do you like solving puzzles? - There are loads of them! You like a good boss battle? There are several!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081760/extras/2025-05-0223-25-25.png?t=1747341922\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game has 100 levels and several secret ones!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081760/extras/Bleb_gf_for_opisanie_gamplay.png?t=1747341922\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interesting mechanics that will not let you get bored</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The whole game is black and white</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are levels on which you can and even need to just relax</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081760/extras/opisanie_1.png?t=1747341922\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game was created by a solo developer.</strong> <i>&quot;I wanted to make a game where after completing each level, the player can say - OH YEAH I DID IT!&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s